      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789515649184,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "c   [] mobile-applicartion\n        : sends all the plates -> service (checks the plate if its in hotlist) -> \n(if no -> the mobile application keeps doing the lloop without clicking any images)\nif yes sends a request for frontend to click \nimages + store the information of the plate(img) + location + time spotted (stores in long term storage)\n        : \n   [] web-client\n        : when registers a complaint -> imedietly add the plate to hotlist \n            checks for the time/ status weathere a fir has been registerd or not \n            if no and time > 24 - 48 hrs : then delete from hotlist\n            if yes: then keep tracking \n        : auth -> for volenteer to register, login\n   [] dashboard\n        : get the vehicle info -> vehicle_no, images, location at what time per time basis, status (fir), photo taken\n            by which user. basically all the info that has been collected  ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "c   [] mobile-applicartion\n        : sends all the plates -> service (checks the plate if its in hotlist) -> \n(if no -> the mobile application keeps doing the lloop without clicking any images)\nif yes sends a request for frontend to click \nimages + store the information of the plate(img) + location + time spotted (stores in long term storage)\n        : \n   [] web-client\n        : when registers a complaint -> imedietly add the plate to hotlist \n            checks for the time/ status weathere a fir has been registerd or not \n            if no and time > 24 - 48 hrs : then delete from hotlist\n            if yes: then keep tracking \n        : auth -> for volenteer to register, login\n   [] dashboard\n        : get the vehicle info -> vehicle_no, images, location at what time per time basis, status (fir), photo taken\n            by which user. basically all the info that has been collected  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
